WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.359 --> 00:00:06.650
Hi my name is Randy Keefe, and I'm from Santiago
California. I graduated from Linfield Christian

00:00:06.650 --> 00:00:13.269
School in 2012, and I'm currently a Political
Economy major at Hillsdale College. This spring

00:00:13.269 --> 00:00:17.370
I'm interning for the Council for National
Policy as part of the Washington Hillsdale

00:00:17.370 --> 00:00:21.030
Internship Program.The Washington Hillsdale
Internship Program, we

00:00:21.030 --> 00:00:26.160
call it WHIP for short, we bring anywhere
between ten to twenty students a semester

00:00:26.160 --> 00:00:31.160
out to DC. They take two or three classes
and they intern on the hill, at the Heritage

00:00:31.160 --> 00:00:35.640
Foundation, really anywhere they want to.
When we find somebody coming out of college

00:00:35.640 --> 00:00:41.050
who has some practical real world experience,
especially experience that applies to what

00:00:41.050 --> 00:00:46.440
we do, it really sets them apart. Washington
is one of those places that kids can learn

00:00:46.440 --> 00:00:51.910
a lot and gain a lot just from being hear
a few moths. And in that since, coming here

00:00:51.910 --> 00:00:55.800
and having that interning experience I guarantee
will be life changing.

